    "created_at": "2016-04-29T09:47:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-29T09:47:16Z",
    "body": "No-op setters of the current type (`boolean` and `Element?`) would suffice for the two snippets at the top of this issue, right?\n\n@upsuper, have you tested those two sites with `[Replaceable]`? It could be that if we're lucky, it just happens to work well enough, but in general the no-op setter seems like lower risk.\n",
